{
  "id": "section-698",
  "title": "对共青团九大的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-078.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>078)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　有为青年多得很，青年一代要打败老一代，我们的未来就是他们的，不要为名望、知识所惧怕，青年人要敢想、敢说、敢做、要从各种狭隘的限制中解放出来。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/1-077.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-079.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
